WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.400
Never touch a woman.

2
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.660
This is the promise between two monks.

3
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:08.580
But then they see a woman struggling to cross a river.

4
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.780
Without a word,

5
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.060
The old monk lifts her,

6
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.560
Walks through the river,

7
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.840
Sets her down safely on the other side.

8
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.220
They walk for hours in silence.

9
00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.420
The old monk is happy,

10
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.360
But the young monk is angry inside.

11
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:25.620
He broke the rule.

12
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:26.980
How could he touch a woman?

13
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.340
And then he explodes.

14
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.940
Master, we're forbidden to touch women.

15
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.560
Yet you carried her.

16
00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.980
The old monk smiles and says,

17
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.420
I left the woman hours ago.

18
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.100
Why are you still carrying her?

19
00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.160
The heaviest thoughts live in our mind,

20
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:47.840
Not our shoulders.

21
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.200
Listen to the old monk,

22
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.080
And drop the weight of your angry thoughts.

23
00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:56.000
A professor puts a rock in an empty jar,
